 be available for a call this week to discuss these points?\n\nLooking forward to continuing our partnership,\nVince\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.08467750064120369) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: conference@techsummit.com\nSubject: Speaker Proposal - AI Security Best Practices\nDate: 2025-10-05T13:20:00Z\nStatus: Draft\nBody:\nDear Conference Organizers,\n\nI'm writing to submit a speaker proposal for your upcoming Tech Summit 2026.\n\nProposed Topic: \"AI Security Best Practices: Protecting Your Models from Adversarial Attacks\"\n\nSession Details:\n- Duration: 45 minutes\n- Format: Presentation with Q&A\n- Target Audience: Developers and Security Professionals\n- Level: Intermediate to Advanced\n\nAbout Me:\n- 5+ years in AI security research\n- Published papers on adversarial machine learning\n- Experience with enterprise security implementations\n\nI believe this topic would be valuable for your attendees. Please let me know if you need any additional information.\n\nBest regards,\nYou\n",
