arget Audience: Developers and Security Professionals\n- Level: Intermediate to Advanced\n\nAbout Me:\n- 5+ years in AI security research\n- Published papers on adversarial machine learning\n- Experience with enterprise security implementations\n\nI believe this topic would be valuable for your attendees. Please let me know if you need any additional information.\n\nBest regards,\nYou\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.10607145842458165) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: hr@company.com\nSubject: Vacation Request - December\nDate: 2025-10-07T08:45:00Z\nStatus: Draft\nBody:\nHi HR Team,\n\nI would like to request vacation time for the following dates:\n\nRequested Dates: December 20-31, 2025\nTotal Days: 8 working days\n\nReason: Family holiday trip\n\nI've ensured that all my current projects will be completed before my departure, and I've arranged for coverage during my absence.\n\nPlease let me know if this request is approved or if you need any additional information.\n\nThank you,\nYou\n",
